                <pb facs="0255" n="135" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg135"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chinese
                    Minister.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-08-29"><hi rendition="#italic">August 29,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis informs Sir Chentung Liang-Cheng that the American China Development
                    Company has definitely accepted the offer of the Chinese Government, and that
                    the Government of the United States will not interpose any obstacles.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
